@SP
Later posters commented on Judi Dench, but not her vision deterioration. I was going to write about that if no one else did. But then I saw your post. It has special meaning to me, since I now have it in one eye and cannot have any further injections, since the first three caused scar tissue formation.

I wrote an answer to your post the other night about anagrams and initialism (CBA), but don't think you saw it, so here it is again: "I had to look up CBA, too. And as an avid reader of medical journals and long time student of medical terminology, I'm aghast at the proliferation of acronyms and initialism in the medical field. I think it's only a matter of time until there is some major catastrophe for a patient because the doctor has misunderstood the initialism."

